\subsubsection{Caching module items}
\label{sec:caching-module-items}

Each module contains items (assignments, pages, files, external URLs, etc.).
These items rarely change after the course is set up, making them good
candidates for caching.

The Canvas API provides both [[get_module_item(id)]] (singular) and
[[get_module_items()]] (plural) methods on the [[Module]] class.
