Submissions that Canvas no longer lists must not make a listing fetch again and
again (\cref{sec:unlisted-submissions}).
Here the scenario spans several requests in which Canvas changes its answer,
which a recording of one state cannot express, so [[responses]] stands in for
Canvas and everything above the HTTP layer is real.

